# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public gym catalogue: search, detail, score summary, review list, lookups.
# WHEN:  After seeding (local) or content changes; after any change to search,
#        filters, scoring, pagination, or caching (ETags).
# WHY:   These are the highest-traffic public endpoints the frontend renders
#        from; they must work anonymously and be cache-friendly.
# WHERE: Any environment; read-only and safe against production.
# AUTH:  None (POST review lives in 30-reviews.http).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Search - default (Active gyms, first page, sorted by name)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms

### Search - full-text term (PostgreSQL FTS + trigram, e.g. typo-tolerant)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?term=mcfit

### Search - district filter (1-23)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?district=7

### Search - chain filter (slug from /chains)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?chain=fitinn

### Search - minimum total score
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?minTotalScore=4

### Search - minimum area scores (membership / studio separately)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?minMembershipScore=3.5&minStudioScore=3

### Search - sorted by best score, custom page size
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?sort=score&page=1&pageSize=5

### Search - sorted by newest
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?sort=newest

### Search - combined filters (what the frontend filter bar sends)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?term=fit&district=15&minTotalScore=3&sort=score&page=1&pageSize=20

### Search - validation error variant
# EXPECT: 400 ProblemDetails (district out of range).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms?district=99

### Gym detail by SEO slug (includes chain, amenities, opening hours, score)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms/{{gymSlug}}

### Gym detail - not found variant
# EXPECT: 404 ProblemDetails (RFC 7807).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms/does-not-exist

### Gym detail - ETag caching variant
# Run "Gym detail" first, copy the ETag response header into If-None-Match.
# EXPECT: 304 Not Modified without a body.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms/{{gymSlug}}
If-None-Match: "REPLACE_WITH_ETAG_FROM_PREVIOUS_RESPONSE"

### Score summary only (total, both areas, all 11 categories, review count)
# WHY: cheaper than full detail; what score widgets should consume.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms/{{gymSlug}}/summary

### Published reviews for a gym (paged; soft-deleted/under-review excluded)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/gyms/{{gymSlug}}/reviews?page=1&pageSize=20

### All chains (for the filter dropdown)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/chains

### All amenities
GET {{host}}/api/v1/amenities
